  "name": "Question 1",
  "problem": "Given that $f(x)=x\\cdot {3}^{x},$ find ${f}^{\u2032}(x).$",
  "worked_solution": "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)=x$ and $v(x)={3}^{x}.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{\u2032}(x) & =(x)^{\u2032}\\cdot {3}^{x}+x\\cdot ({3}^{x})^{\u2032} \\\\  & ={3}^{x}+(x)(\\operatorname{ln}\u20613\\cdot {3}^{x}) \\\\  & ={3}^{x}+x\\operatorname{ln}\u20613\\cdot {3}^{x} \\\\  & =(1+x\\operatorname{ln}\u20613){3}^{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
